import lib/std.dl

class:
    patterns:
        [an|] example action
    members:
        success as a boolean

a successful example action means: @intrinsic("construct", an example action, true)

a failed example action means: @intrinsic("construct", an example action, false)

to get {example action:action} succeeded:
    return action's success

flex function perform a successful example action:
    replacement:
        set the subject to a successful example action

flex function perform a failed example action:
    replacement:
        set the subject to a failed example action

to preserve subject through branch condition:
    set the subject to a successful example action
    if condition:
        ignore 1
    else:
        ignore 2
    print line it succeeded

perform a successful example action and print line it succeeded
perform a failed example action and print line it succeeded
perform a successful example action
print lines (it succeeded), (true and false) and (true and true)
preserve subject through branch true
preserve subject through branch false
